\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
Does the intersection of two base polytopes of strongly base orderable matroids have the Integer Caratheodory Property; does the r-arborescence polytope have this property; and can matroids admit a more intuitive greedy decomposition into affinely independent integral vectors? \href{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2011/53}{[S2]}
